{"steam_appid":3557530,"steam_name":"Bug Cleaners","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557530/2050054271/67b8515679c6f7a868c7a32c24dcaed28dc7cbd2/1790467065/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790468340","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257430123/b1424f0f8182b47b5f492e49755f14ff015c467d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790468340","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/02975bdb6045f800d9aece160131af9d051e71e3/ss_02975bdb6045f800d9aece160131af9d051e71e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790600414","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/bdff2fa2b48855d411bc957e998b242f1bb9ab46/ss_bdff2fa2b48855d411bc957e998b242f1bb9ab46.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790600414","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/350d40489b7035305868f8210b30e578b734bfed/ss_350d40489b7035305868f8210b30e578b734bfed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790600414","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/1f7a9a25cbfb9818c537a8d32e8be44d3e2de1b8/ss_1f7a9a25cbfb9818c537a8d32e8be44d3e2de1b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790600414","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/ae77ec59cbac7e041a7c20ae84633227af655b94/ss_ae77ec59cbac7e041a7c20ae84633227af655b94.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790600414"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐛 Bugs are everywhere!<br>It's time to clean them up! Build your team or go solo—stop this invasion!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2661b6bf6df15daa5eaac2fc19078a91.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2661b6bf6df15daa5eaac2fc19078a91.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2661b6bf6df15daa5eaac2fc19078a91.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Burn them with the blowtorch!<br>Use the power of fire to burn the invaders to a crisp!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/9b58fec3bcf1726e8fcd6f81ad1fea5f.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/9b58fec3bcf1726e8fcd6f81ad1fea5f.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/9b58fec3bcf1726e8fcd6f81ad1fea5f.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦟 Spray them with the pesticide machine!<br>Force the bugs to disappear into the toxic mist!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/1facfdf94e255905b16e1ce21107b109.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/1facfdf94e255905b16e1ce21107b109.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/1facfdf94e255905b16e1ce21107b109.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Vacuum them up with the vacuum cleaner!<br>Suck them all up in one go and leave behind a pristine area!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2dee871976fc5b44cf5f1bfe02c7174b.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2dee871976fc5b44cf5f1bfe02c7174b.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/2dee871976fc5b44cf5f1bfe02c7174b.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Detect bugs with your trained cat, Sniffers!<br>Sniffers can sense bugs in any area it sniffs! With its warnings, every corner is ready to be cleaned. A fast and reliable helper—always by your side on this mission!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/fe5df356a3f4f7bebe877e572f5ff275.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/fe5df356a3f4f7bebe877e572f5ff275.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/fe5df356a3f4f7bebe877e572f5ff275.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👣 Squish bugs with your hands, stomp them mercilessly with your feet!<br>Sometimes, getting the job done means squishing bugs in one swipe with your hands and stomping them with your feet—end for the bugs, relaxation for you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.poster.avif?t=1790600414\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.webm?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/extras/4c4ba668ecfa4dd5d3bb0e6a7e606033.mp4?t=1790600414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Chaotic missions, absurd humor, fun cleaning!<br>Ready for the craziest cleaning experience, solo or with your team!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 580 / AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["dicehit"],"publishers":["dicehit"],"release_date":"Sep 28, 2026"}